{"page":10,"width":1820,"height":2503,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"알고리즘이란?","words":[{"text":"알고리즘이란?","x":198,"y":216,"width":238,"height":43}]},{"text":"어떤 문제가 주이지 있고 이것을 컴퓨터로 해결하려고 한다고 가정하자. 첫 번째 해야 할 일은","words":[{"text":"어떤","x":199,"y":292,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"문제가","x":268,"y":291,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"주이지","x":368,"y":291,"width":82,"height":34},{"text":"있고","x":468,"y":291,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"이것을","x":538,"y":291,"width":85,"height":33},{"text":"컴퓨터로","x":638,"y":292,"width":113,"height":33},{"text":"해결하려고","x":764,"y":292,"width":143,"height":33},{"text":"한다고","x":920,"y":291,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"가정하자.","x":1021,"y":291,"width":121,"height":33},{"text":"첫","x":1161,"y":291,"width":26,"height":33},{"text":"번째","x":1202,"y":290,"width":54,"height":33},{"text":"해야","x":1272,"y":289,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"할","x":1341,"y":289,"width":30,"height":32},{"text":"일은","x":1384,"y":288,"width":56,"height":33}]},{"text":"문제를 해결할 수 있는 방법을 고안하는 것이다. 예를 들면 컴퓨터를 이용하여 전화번호부에서","words":[{"text":"문제를","x":197,"y":348,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"해결할","x":297,"y":347,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"수","x":395,"y":347,"width":29,"height":33},{"text":"있는","x":438,"y":346,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"방법을","x":507,"y":346,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"고안하는","x":606,"y":348,"width":114,"height":33},{"text":"것이다.","x":734,"y":348,"width":92,"height":32},{"text":"예를","x":843,"y":347,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"들면","x":912,"y":347,"width":56,"height":32},{"text":"컴퓨터를","x":984,"y":346,"width":114,"height":33},{"text":"이용하여","x":1111,"y":346,"width":111,"height":34},{"text":"전화번호부에서","x":1240,"y":343,"width":195,"height":35}]},{"text":"특정한 사람의 이름-을 찾는 문제를 생각하여 보자. 한 가지 방법은 전화번호부의 첫 페이지부","words":[{"text":"특정한","x":197,"y":403,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"사람의","x":297,"y":402,"width":84,"height":34},{"text":"이름-을","x":399,"y":402,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"찾는","x":498,"y":402,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"문제를","x":569,"y":403,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"생각하여","x":670,"y":403,"width":112,"height":33},{"text":"보자.","x":799,"y":403,"width":64,"height":33},{"text":"한","x":880,"y":402,"width":30,"height":32},{"text":"가지","x":924,"y":402,"width":54,"height":33},{"text":"방법은","x":995,"y":402,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"전화번호부의","x":1096,"y":401,"width":169,"height":34},{"text":"첫","x":1282,"y":401,"width":27,"height":33},{"text":"페이지부","x":1325,"y":400,"width":114,"height":34}]},{"text":"터 시작하여 한 장씩 넘기면서 특정한 사람을 찾는 것이다. 이 방법은 엄청난 시간이 걸리는 방","words":[{"text":"터","x":198,"y":459,"width":24,"height":33},{"text":"시작하여","x":238,"y":458,"width":111,"height":34},{"text":"한","x":364,"y":458,"width":30,"height":32},{"text":"장씩","x":405,"y":458,"width":54,"height":33},{"text":"넘기면서","x":476,"y":458,"width":111,"height":33},{"text":"특정한","x":602,"y":459,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"사람을","x":700,"y":458,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"찾는","x":799,"y":458,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"것이다.","x":869,"y":458,"width":92,"height":33},{"text":"이","x":978,"y":458,"width":24,"height":32},{"text":"방법은","x":1018,"y":458,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"엄청난","x":1118,"y":458,"width":85,"height":33},{"text":"시간이","x":1214,"y":457,"width":82,"height":34},{"text":"걸리는","x":1313,"y":457,"width":85,"height":33},{"text":"방","x":1410,"y":456,"width":28,"height":33}]},{"text":"법이고 보통 이런 식으로 찾는 사람은 거의 없을 것이다. 또 하나의 방법은 전화번호부의 이름들","words":[{"text":"법이고","x":198,"y":515,"width":84,"height":32},{"text":"보통","x":293,"y":515,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"이런","x":361,"y":514,"width":55,"height":33},{"text":"식으로","x":429,"y":514,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"찾는","x":526,"y":514,"width":59,"height":32},{"text":"사람은","x":595,"y":514,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"거의","x":693,"y":514,"width":54,"height":34},{"text":"없을","x":762,"y":514,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"것이다.","x":830,"y":513,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"또","x":936,"y":517,"width":29,"height":24},{"text":"하나의","x":976,"y":513,"width":82,"height":34},{"text":"방법은","x":1072,"y":513,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"전화번호부의","x":1169,"y":512,"width":169,"height":34},{"text":"이름들","x":1352,"y":512,"width":87,"height":33}]},{"text":"이 정렬되어 있음을 이용하는 방법이다. 즉 찾고자 하는 이름이 “박철수”라고 하자. 전화번호부","words":[{"text":"이","x":197,"y":570,"width":24,"height":32},{"text":"정렬되어","x":237,"y":570,"width":110,"height":33},{"text":"있음을","x":365,"y":570,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"이용하는","x":463,"y":569,"width":116,"height":34},{"text":"방법이다.","x":591,"y":570,"width":121,"height":33},{"text":"즉","x":728,"y":571,"width":29,"height":32},{"text":"찾고자","x":769,"y":570,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"하는","x":868,"y":570,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"이름이","x":939,"y":569,"width":81,"height":34},{"text":"“박철수”라고","x":1035,"y":569,"width":167,"height":34},{"text":"하자.","x":1214,"y":569,"width":63,"height":33},{"text":"전화번호부","x":1295,"y":568,"width":143,"height":33}]},{"text":"의 중간에 있는 이름과 “박철수”를 비교한다. 중간에 있는 이름보다 앞에 있다면 앞부분만 검색","words":[{"text":"의","x":195,"y":626,"width":25,"height":32},{"text":"중간에","x":235,"y":625,"width":83,"height":33},{"text":"있는","x":334,"y":626,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"이름과","x":403,"y":625,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"“박철수”를","x":502,"y":626,"width":139,"height":33},{"text":"비교한다.","x":655,"y":626,"width":120,"height":34},{"text":"중간에","x":791,"y":626,"width":85,"height":33},{"text":"있는","x":892,"y":626,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"이름보다","x":961,"y":625,"width":114,"height":33},{"text":"앞에","x":1087,"y":625,"width":54,"height":33},{"text":"있다면","x":1157,"y":625,"width":83,"height":33},{"text":"앞부분만","x":1254,"y":624,"width":114,"height":34},{"text":"검색","x":1381,"y":624,"width":54,"height":33}]},{"text":"한다. 그렇지 않다면 뒷부분만 검색하면 된다. 이러한 과정을 박철수란 이름을 찾을 때까지 되풀","words":[{"text":"한다.","x":194,"y":681,"width":63,"height":32},{"text":"그렇지","x":272,"y":681,"width":83,"height":33},{"text":"않다면","x":369,"y":681,"width":85,"height":33},{"text":"뒷부분만","x":467,"y":680,"width":116,"height":33},{"text":"검색하면","x":595,"y":682,"width":113,"height":33},{"text":"된다.","x":720,"y":681,"width":64,"height":33},{"text":"이러한","x":800,"y":681,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"과정을","x":897,"y":681,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"박철수란","x":995,"y":681,"width":115,"height":33},{"text":"이름을","x":1121,"y":681,"width":84,"height":33},{"text":"찾을","x":1216,"y":680,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"때까지","x":1284,"y":680,"width":82,"height":33},{"text":"되풀","x":1380,"y":680,"width":58,"height":32}]},{"text":"이 한다. 이 방법은 굉장히 효율적인 방법이고 일반적인 사람들이 A卜%하는 방법이다. 이러한 방","words":[{"text":"이","x":195,"y":736,"width":24,"height":32},{"text":"한다.","x":232,"y":736,"width":64,"height":32},{"text":"이","x":312,"y":736,"width":24,"height":32},{"text":"방법은","x":350,"y":736,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"굉장히","x":447,"y":736,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"효율적인","x":544,"y":737,"width":116,"height":33},{"text":"방법이고","x":672,"y":737,"width":116,"height":33},{"text":"일반적인","x":800,"y":737,"width":114,"height":33},{"text":"사람들이","x":925,"y":737,"width":113,"height":33},{"text":"A卜%하는","x":1051,"y":737,"width":116,"height":33},{"text":"방법이다.","x":1177,"y":736,"width":121,"height":34},{"text":"이러한","x":1313,"y":736,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"방","x":1409,"y":735,"width":29,"height":33}]},{"text":"법들은 보통 프로그래밍 스타일이나 프로그래밍 언어와는 무관하다. 즉 C언어를 사공하건. Java","words":[{"text":"법들은","x":194,"y":792,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"보통","x":288,"y":793,"width":58,"height":31},{"text":"프로그래밍","x":355,"y":791,"width":141,"height":32},{"text":"스타일이나","x":509,"y":792,"width":147,"height":33},{"text":"프로그래밍","x":665,"y":792,"width":143,"height":32},{"text":"언어와는","x":824,"y":792,"width":115,"height":33},{"text":"무관하다.","x":949,"y":793,"width":122,"height":33},{"text":"즉","x":1085,"y":794,"width":29,"height":31},{"text":"C언어를","x":1124,"y":793,"width":106,"height":33},{"text":"사공하건.","x":1238,"y":792,"width":122,"height":33},{"text":"Java","x":1372,"y":794,"width":66,"height":27}]},{"text":"를 사우하건, A卜우되는 방법은 동일하다.","words":[{"text":"를","x":192,"y":849,"width":29,"height":30},{"text":"사우하건,","x":230,"y":847,"width":121,"height":33},{"text":"A卜우되는","x":365,"y":846,"width":115,"height":33},{"text":"방법은","x":490,"y":846,"width":89,"height":32},{"text":"동일하다.","x":587,"y":847,"width":123,"height":33}]},{"text":"박철수를","words":[{"text":"박철수를","x":265,"y":979,"width":86,"height":24}]},{"text":"중간에 있는 이름과","words":[{"text":"중간에","x":212,"y":1018,"width":64,"height":25},{"text":"있는","x":287,"y":1017,"width":43,"height":24},{"text":"이름과","x":339,"y":1016,"width":64,"height":24}]},{"text":"비교하자.","words":[{"text":"비교하자.","x":262,"y":1054,"width":90,"height":25}]},{"text":"[그림 1-4] 알고리즘의 예","words":[{"text":"[그림","x":191,"y":1444,"width":55,"height":30},{"text":"1-4]","x":257,"y":1444,"width":49,"height":30},{"text":"알고리즘의","x":324,"y":1445,"width":110,"height":26},{"text":"예","x":445,"y":1444,"width":20,"height":25}]},{"text":"두 번째로 해야 할 일은 이들 방법에 따라 컴퓨터가 수행하여야 할 단계적인 절지를 자세히 기","words":[{"text":"두","x":222,"y":1557,"width":30,"height":30},{"text":"번째로","x":264,"y":1555,"width":84,"height":32},{"text":"해야","x":358,"y":1554,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"할","x":424,"y":1553,"width":30,"height":31},{"text":"일은","x":465,"y":1553,"width":57,"height":31},{"text":"이들","x":532,"y":1552,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"방법에","x":600,"y":1552,"width":84,"height":32},{"text":"따라","x":697,"y":1551,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"컴퓨터가","x":766,"y":1551,"width":118,"height":33},{"text":"수행하여야","x":892,"y":1552,"width":149,"height":32},{"text":"할","x":1049,"y":1553,"width":31,"height":30},{"text":"단계적인","x":1088,"y":1552,"width":115,"height":31},{"text":"절지를","x":1216,"y":1552,"width":86,"height":31},{"text":"자세히","x":1312,"y":1551,"width":84,"height":32},{"text":"기","x":1411,"y":1551,"width":24,"height":32}]},{"text":"술하는 것이다. 컴퓨터로 문제를 풀기 위한 단계적인 절차를 알고리즘(algonthm)이라고 한다.","words":[{"text":"술하는","x":188,"y":1608,"width":89,"height":33},{"text":"것이다.","x":290,"y":1609,"width":91,"height":32},{"text":"컴퓨터로","x":399,"y":1607,"width":113,"height":33},{"text":"문제를","x":524,"y":1606,"width":89,"height":32},{"text":"풀기","x":624,"y":1607,"width":55,"height":31},{"text":"위한","x":697,"y":1606,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"단계적인","x":767,"y":1606,"width":116,"height":32},{"text":"절차를","x":899,"y":1606,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"알고리즘(algonthm)이라고","x":998,"y":1605,"width":358,"height":34},{"text":"한다.","x":1369,"y":1605,"width":65,"height":31}]},{"text":"엄밀하게 이야기하면 알고리즘이란 문제와 컴퓨터가 주어진 상태에서 문제를 해결하는 방법을","words":[{"text":"엄밀하게","x":191,"y":1663,"width":111,"height":33},{"text":"이야기하면","x":319,"y":1662,"width":140,"height":33},{"text":"알고리즘이란","x":474,"y":1661,"width":175,"height":32},{"text":"문제와","x":660,"y":1661,"width":90,"height":32},{"text":"컴퓨터가","x":763,"y":1660,"width":117,"height":32},{"text":"주어진","x":891,"y":1661,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"상태에서","x":991,"y":1660,"width":113,"height":32},{"text":"문제를","x":1119,"y":1659,"width":89,"height":31},{"text":"해결하는","x":1220,"y":1659,"width":117,"height":31},{"text":"방법을","x":1350,"y":1658,"width":89,"height":32}]},{"text":"정밀하게 장치가 이해할 수 있는 언어로 기술한 것이다. 따라서 알고리즘은 특정한 일을 수행하","words":[{"text":"정밀하게","x":190,"y":1717,"width":112,"height":33},{"text":"장치가","x":316,"y":1717,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"이해할","x":414,"y":1716,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"수","x":510,"y":1716,"width":30,"height":31},{"text":"있는","x":553,"y":1716,"width":57,"height":31},{"text":"언어로","x":623,"y":1715,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"기술한","x":720,"y":1715,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"것이다.","x":819,"y":1714,"width":92,"height":33},{"text":"따라서","x":928,"y":1714,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"알고리즘은","x":1026,"y":1713,"width":144,"height":32},{"text":"특정한","x":1179,"y":1713,"width":90,"height":31},{"text":"일을","x":1281,"y":1712,"width":57,"height":31},{"text":"수행하","x":1348,"y":1713,"width":91,"height":31}]},{"text":"는 명령어들의 집합이다. 여기서 명령어란 컴퓨터에서 수행되는 문장들을 의미한다. 모든 명령","words":[{"text":"는","x":187,"y":1773,"width":31,"height":29},{"text":"명령어들의","x":232,"y":1772,"width":139,"height":33},{"text":"집합이다.","x":388,"y":1771,"width":120,"height":32},{"text":"여기서","x":526,"y":1770,"width":82,"height":32},{"text":"명령어란","x":626,"y":1769,"width":117,"height":33},{"text":"컴퓨터에서","x":756,"y":1769,"width":139,"height":32},{"text":"수행되는","x":910,"y":1768,"width":118,"height":32},{"text":"문장들을","x":1038,"y":1766,"width":116,"height":33},{"text":"의미한다.","x":1167,"y":1766,"width":123,"height":32},{"text":"모든","x":1306,"y":1767,"width":59,"height":29},{"text":"명령","x":1379,"y":1766,"width":54,"height":33}]},{"text":"어들의 집합이 알고리즘이 되는 것은 아니고 알고리즘이 되기 위한 조건들을 만족히는 집합만이","words":[{"text":"어들의","x":189,"y":1826,"width":83,"height":33},{"text":"집합이","x":288,"y":1827,"width":81,"height":32},{"text":"알고리즘이","x":384,"y":1826,"width":140,"height":32},{"text":"되는","x":539,"y":1825,"width":58,"height":31},{"text":"것은","x":609,"y":1825,"width":57,"height":31},{"text":"아니고","x":677,"y":1825,"width":87,"height":31},{"text":"알고리즘이","x":774,"y":1824,"width":141,"height":32},{"text":"되기","x":930,"y":1823,"width":53,"height":32},{"text":"위한","x":998,"y":1823,"width":58,"height":31},{"text":"조건들을","x":1064,"y":1821,"width":116,"height":31},{"text":"만족히는","x":1191,"y":1820,"width":117,"height":32},{"text":"집합만이","x":1320,"y":1819,"width":113,"height":34}]},{"text":"알고리즘으로 정의된다","words":[{"text":"알고리즘으로","x":189,"y":1881,"width":174,"height":33},{"text":"정의된다","x":373,"y":1881,"width":121,"height":32}]},{"text":"알고리즘","words":[{"text":"알고리즘","x":402,"y":1998,"width":93,"height":25}]},{"text":"정의 1.1","words":[{"text":"정의","x":250,"y":2000,"width":41,"height":25},{"text":"1.1","x":300,"y":2000,"width":28,"height":22}]},{"text":"• 입 력 : 0개 이상의 입력이 존재하여야한다.","words":[{"text":"•","x":225,"y":2069,"width":7,"height":8},{"text":"입","x":244,"y":2060,"width":22,"height":25},{"text":"력","x":294,"y":2059,"width":20,"height":26},{"text":":","x":328,"y":2064,"width":4,"height":17},{"text":"0개","x":344,"y":205